 "cell_contents": "Four nominal Mg0.9Al0.2Si0.9O3 formula units per conventional orthorhombic Pbnm cell (Z=4). The source establishes the composition, lattice, and space group but publishes neither fractional coordinates nor Al site occupancies. The stored atom_sites are therefore an explicitly identified MgSiO3 Pbnm positional-topology proxy and do not encode the specimen composition or an experimentally determined Al distribution.",
