  "publisher_pdf_sha256": "70fd8aac56e920c21442ed6884b24024e839f34b2b561f7f0b55aab178a3c214"
 },
 "notes": "Composition-specific Fe-free aluminous bridgmanite synthesized from a 90 mol% MgSiO3 plus 10 mol% Al2O3 glass. EPMA confirmed Mg0.9Al0.2Si0.9O3 within analytical error. The source later discusses equal Al occupation of large and small sites only as a hypothetical interpretation, so no site partition is asserted here. The stored lattice is the more precise of two mutually consistent atmospheric measurements. Its rounded a*b*c product is 163.585 A^3 and agrees with the printed 163.6(4) A^3 conventional-cell volume. Pbnm perovskite has Z=4; that cell content is a crystallographic inference because the paper does not explicitly print Z. The positional model is a pure-MgSiO3 topology proxy, not a composition-bearing refinement.",
 "eos_records": [
